    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helili Yeremiya wuchidi saŋa amwenzelelawu muchipaŋu chaawatulama, izu daYehova hidikwinza kudi yena kamu chiyedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yehova mukwakuchikoŋa, Yehova mukwakuchituŋa kulonda kuchishimatisha, wukweti ijina daYehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nahoshi nindi, Ntambiki, nakakwitiya, nakakuleja yuma yamaneni yakala, yakadi kwilukeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova, Nzambi yaIsarela, nateni matala amumukala wunu, nimatala awanyanta jawaYuda anahumunuwu nansaŋu janyikandu, ninansaŋu jampoku jatubali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Anenzi nakulwa nawaKaladeya, kulonda akayinzeshi nayibimbi yawantu najahili hakuzuwa kwami, nihakulendumuka kwami, nansaŋu jawantu ejima akweti kutama kunaleteshi kubuta kumesu ami, nibuli kutala mukaliwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, nakawuletela kukola, nikuditiyaku, nakayuka kwami. Nakayimwekeshela kuwunda kwakuvulu ninsaŋu yalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakafuntisha aYuda nawaIsarela ayili muwukoli, nakayituŋa neyi hakusambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayitookesha kuluwa kwawu kwejima kwananvulumunuwu. Nakayanakena kuluwaluwa kwawu kwejima kwakunvulumuna nikwakunmotoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaliwu kudami wakekala wejina dakuluŋa, wakushimeka, wampuhu, kumesu anyuza yahanu hamaseki yejima yakatiya kuwaha kwejima kunakayila, yakatiya woma nakuzaala, nakuwaha kwejima, nakumwena kwejima kunakayiletela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Munu mwelaŋawu nawu, Muchihembi chakadi antu hela anyama, munyikala yamuYuda nimunyikwakwa yamuYerusalema muneli yihembi yakadi antu, yakadi ashakamamu, yakadi hela anyama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakatiyakana cheŋi izu dakuluŋa, niizu dakutiya kuwaha, niizu dansunambuli, niizu dansumbuki, nimazu awantu akwila nawu, Musakililenu Yehova wamazaza, muloŋa Yehova himuwahi, luwi lwindi lwahaya nyaka; nimazu awantu akuleta yimuna yakusakilila mwitala daYehova. Muloŋa ami nakafuntisha antu amwituŋayili muwukoli, akekali neyi chadiŋuwu hakusambila. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Mwenamunu mwela dehi kwachihembi chakadi antu hela anyama, nimunyikala yawu yejima, mwakekala muwushakaminu wawatubiŋa akakamikaŋa nyikanka yawu yanyikoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimunyikala yakwituŋa damapidi, nimunyikala yakunkulu, nimunyikala yakukabeta kakuchidiilu, nimwituŋa daBenjamini, ninamutunyikala tudi kwakwihi naYerusalema, nimunyikala yamuYuda, mwishina damakasa amukwakuchinda mwakahita cheŋi nyikanka yanyikoku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, kwamba kenza mafuku inamba kakoŋa izu dadiwahidi nateneneni mutaŋa waIsarela namutaŋa waYuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumafuku owu, kumpinji oyu namba kamumeneshela Davidi Mutayi wakuloŋa. Wakela niyawuŋaji niyakuloŋa mwituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumafuku owu aYuda amba kayamwina, niYerusalema wamba kashakama chachiwahi chakadi kwakama. Amba kanamutumbawu, nawu, Yehova hikuloŋa kwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nahoshi nindi, Davidi hamba kabula muntu wakushakama hetanda dawanta damutaŋa waIsarelaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niatupristu aLevi hiyamba kabula muntu kumesu ami wakulambulaŋa nyilambu yakushita, hela wakwochaŋa nyilambu yawuŋa, hela wakuketulaŋa yimuna hefuku hefukuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili kudi Yeremiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yehova nahoshi nindi, Neyi mwakatwesha kujaha chitiyaŋenu chami chamwaana, nichitiyaŋenu chami chawufuku, mwaka mwakabuli kwikala mwaana nawufuku hawu hekalilaŋawu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "komana nichitiyaŋenu chami chinatiyaŋeni nakambuŋami Davidi akatwesha kuchŋaha, mwaka yena akabuli muntu wakuyula hetanda dindi dawanta, nichitiyaŋenu chami chinatiyaŋeni nawankoŋi jami atupristu aLevi, akatwesha kuchŋaha nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakaŋanyaŋa wu kuchinda yileŋaleŋa yamwiwulu, nichakaŋanyaloŋawu kweseka wusekulula wakukaluŋalwiji, dichi namba kavulisha anyana kakambuŋami Davidi, niaLevi ankalakelaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
